    {
      "id": "evidence-000-notes",
      "kind": {
        "text": "Seven tests, a nonzero count (the filter is not inert). The generalization is a lambda-abstraction of the 30 `Real` constants out of a term `reconstruct_lra_proof` already built and gated; the statement is whatever `Kernel::infer` returns for the abstracted term, never written by hand, so an axiom whose type changed would change the hypothesis rather than silently disagree with it. `--features full` is mandatory: without it the solver's full test surface is not compiled.",
